# Weakens R's InitHeadCoversPriorAllocations in this module's environment: the
# re-created incarnation's first initialisation records a head above every straddler
# but not above a foreign record a window the purge left open holds. That record is
# then bounded by nothing, and the re-created incarnation's live advance passes it.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestAssumeInitHeadBelowForeign
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the first initialisation's head covers straddlers only
PERTURBS: MarkInit
BOUNDS: WithRecreate = TRUE, WithUnclaimedSurvivor = FALSE, WithPreArm = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ \E h \in HeadsAbove({Foreign, Straddler}) : hoClosedAt' = Max2(hoClosedAt, h)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the head covers straddlers only.
    /\ \E h \in HeadsAbove({Straddler}) : hoClosedAt' = Max2(hoClosedAt, h)
--- END
